title: help:focus
tags: [[GUI command]]
kind: reference
summary: Help: focus the search box (clear: empty it first)

`help:focus search [clear]` — <<key "help:focus search" "p e">>: gives the search box of the [[help panel]] the focus, its text kept. With `clear` (<<key "help:focus search clear" "p Shift+e">>) the box is emptied first, which lists every page again, ready for a new search.
